    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You grew up in a land of living god-kings, raised on countless tales of ancient empires and buried cities. In those stories, Mulhorand overflowed with forgotten riches—priceless treasures waiting for anyone clever and brave enough to find them. You have made it your mission to explore the crypts, tombs, and pyramids of your homeland and reclaim the relics of your people.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Dexterity, Constitution, Intelligence</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.0FdfMi10b60fl9Wt]{Lucky}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Investigation and Religion</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulMasonsTool]{Mason's Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepDagger0000]{Dagger}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepLightHamme]{Light Hammer}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulMasonsTool]{Mason's Tools}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBackpack000]{Backpack}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBedroll0000]{Bedroll}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagCrowbar0000]{Crowbar}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagLadder00000]{Ladder}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPole0000000]{Pole}, 2 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPouch000000]{Pouches}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRope0000000]{Rope}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagString00000]{String}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTinderbox00]{Tinderbox}, 5 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTorch000000]{Torches}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagWaterskin00]{Waterskin}, 26 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
